-- The combat styles the reopened classes never had.
--
-- A Vampiir had no attack to train. It carries the Piercing specialisation and
-- Piercing has fifteen styles here -- for Blademaster, Hero, Champion,
-- Nightshade and Ranger. There were none for class 58, so there was nothing to
-- put on a quickbar and no way into melee at all.
--
-- The same for every class that was switched off: Heretic, Valkyrie and the
-- three Maulers had not one style between them. Bainshee and Warlock have none
-- in the reference either, and that is correct -- they are pure casters.
--
-- 542 styles missing overall, so this is not only the reopened classes.
--
-- StyleID is the primary key and the reference numbering collides with ours,
-- so these are renumbered above our maximum. Nothing references those numbers:
-- styles are found by ID and ClassId, which are preserved exactly.

